            <div id="dsq-comment-message-278" class="dsq-comment-message"><p>So, you&#8217;re not a big fan of the YAGNI approach?  I find, more often than not, people who say &#8220;YAGNI&#8221; or &#8220;KISS&#8221; have difficulty designing/implementing at the higher levels of abstraction needed to support future efforts.  </p>
