            <div id="dsq-comment-message-282" class="dsq-comment-message"><p>&#8220;So, you&#8217;re not a big fan of YAGNI approach?&#8221;  &#8211; I don&#8217;t think you read the whole thing <img src="http://cromwellhaus.com/wp-includes/images/smilies/simple-smile.png" alt=":)" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /></p>
<p>I&#8217;m not  sure I follow your second part.  If you&#8217;re saying people you I&#8217;m being Agile, YAGNI, etc as a cop-out for quality and discipline then I agree it does happen.  Then again, people also use quality and craftsmanship as a cop-out for actually shipping.  It goes both ways.</p>
